：微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：铃兰打工小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-07-08 20:53<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FlU4B1UKSwfikPdpB7YvbEQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lU4B1UKSwfikPdpB7YvbEQ</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息139.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF139.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"90\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row nowrap; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; width: 95%; vertical-align: top; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; border-style: solid; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(95, 156, 239); height: auto; padding: 26px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;\">尊敬的团长们：</p><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\" data-filtered=\"filtered\" /></p><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;\">2023 TapTap 游戏发布会大家看得怎么样！各大游戏纷纷出手，果然是看得人眼花缭乱哇✧*｡ (ˊᗜˋ*) ✧*&#160;</p><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\" data-filtered=\"filtered\" /></p><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;\">看到【铃兰之剑】出现的那一刻，团长们的内心有没有很激动呢~</p><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;\">为了方便团长们反复欣赏（误），特此发布【铃兰之剑】的单独宣传片~</p><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\" data-filtered=\"filtered\" /></p></div>\n<div class=\"bvideo\" data-id=\"BV1dU4y1i7gH\" data-cid=\"0\" data-page=\"1\" data-title=\"【铃兰之剑】2023TapTap游戏发布会PV\" data-width=\"440\" data-height=\"220\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br data-filtered=\"filtered\" /></p><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\">等待的日子是辛苦的，正因如此，迎来曙光的那一刻将会倍加幸福~</p><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\">为了实现和团长的约定，我们会努力地一步步走向团长，期待与各位团长的正式见面~</p><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br data-filtered=\"filtered\" /></p></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br data-filtered=\"filtered\" /></p></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\">为了感谢团长们长久以来的支持，特为团长们带来福利活动！</p><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\">BiliBili、TapTap两平台都有福利，团长们可以积极参与哦~</p><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br data-filtered=\"filtered\" /></p></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br data-filtered=\"filtered\" /></p></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br data-filtered=\"filtered\" /></p></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\">点击 阅读原文 查看更多活动信息~<br /><br /></p></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;transform: translate3d(-31px, 0px, 0px);margin-bottom: -30px;\">\n</div></div></div>\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息138.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b0/pdkoq2bc59leqjtmh9hij43e1io77b3.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1078\" height=\"490\" data-file-width=\"1078\" data-file-height=\"490\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163724\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 155/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2484/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 326/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/4